Name: Moonshine streaming inference
URL: https://github.com/moonshine-ai/moonshine
Version: 0.1.6
Revision: d8d8fa29d05ca67441a7719e70099f9f48917a93
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Only the streaming inference core and MIT streaming packs are used. Community-
licensed and legacy non-streaming models are excluded. Native policy changes
are in voice_engine/patches/native-sandbox.patch. Models are not bundled: each
requires an explicit size-labelled download. See voice_engine/model_manifest.json.

The model catalog includes English Medium Streaming from quantized_26_11_02,
with eight SHA-256-pinned assets totalling 269306511 bytes. Existing Small
and Tiny model pins are retained.
